type project
version 1
---
# og-ui's documents, bindings and layer stack (docs/ui.md §8, §9, §10) in
# one sample: a HUD screen bound to the Wallet resource, and a shop screen
# document bound to a viewmodel, pushed over it as a menu layer that dims
# and pauses what is under it; its preview slot filled by code, its Buy
# event answered by code, and its props adjusted live through the probe's
# ui:set and written back into assets/ui/shop.ogt by ui:save.
name "UI shop"
id "ui-shop"
engine "0.7.7"
entry "src/main.ts"
profile "2d"
tick 60
seed 1
